                    caption: "(a, b): Echocardiographic findings confirming critical stenosis of the CoreValve aortic bioprosthesis. (a) Heavy. calcification and flow propagation over the aortic valve (AV);. (b) continuous-wave Doppler flow measurement demonstrating. severe aortic valve stenosis. [Color figure can be viewed in the online issue, which is available at wileyonlinelibrary.com.]."
