                    caption: "Computed tomography angiography (CTA) images. showing (A-C) the extensive TAA, involving ascending aorta,. aortic arch, and descending aorta; and (D-F) the end-result of the \"full metal jacket\" aorta, after surgical repair of the. ascending aorta and aortic arch with construction of a Yshaped prosthetic graft, TAvR, and thoracic endovascular aortic repair (TEVAR) procedure."
