                    caption: "(A) Aortography demonstrating Grade 3 AR. (B) An exchange length hydrophilic 0.035' (Terumo, Tokyo) guide wire directed across the leak into the left ventricle. (C) 8-mm Amplatzer Vascular Plug (Avp4) delivered down a 4F MPA catheter (Cordis, Miami Lakes, FL) between the valve skirt and aortic annulus. (D) Aortography demonstrating a reduction in AR to grade 0."
