        Files: {
            PDF: "D:/Romy/SAIRI/TAVI/Code/pdf_downloads/10.1002_ccd.27383.pdf",
            Images: [
                {
                    path: "D:/Romy/SAIRI/TAVI/Code/extract_downloads/10.1002_ccd.27383/images/171a6191e613eaa7fc2729fe93aa5cc3930261654a8b56355e74461a16749329.jpg",
                    caption: "The MANTATM vascular closure system component parts (annotated) [Color figure can be viewed at wileyonlinelibrary.com."
                },
                {
                    path: "D:/Romy/SAIRI/TAVI/Code/extract_downloads/10.1002_ccd.27383/images/2ad85ec3f39802dfd95d59fdd51741d282551f046324d119140627b7d41e2b88.jpg",
                    caption: "Imaging modalities to assess vascular access and closure for the axillary approach. Upper left panel: preprocedure multislice computed tomography. Upper right panel: ultrasound-guided puncture during procedure. Lower panel: postclosure angiogram with MANTATM radio-opaque marker (white arrow) [Color figure can be viewed at wileyonlinelibrary.com]"
                },
                {
                    path: "D:/Romy/SAIRI/TAVI/Code/extract_downloads/10.1002_ccd.27383/images/2b019bc1617726da566cb31c836acf8adccb5b4b306cb9bb9f03d59320d9007c.jpg",
                    caption: "MANTATM deployment sequence schematic. A, after puncture/introduction of guidewire (in black) the locator (in blue) with external graduations is used to estimate puncture depth (black arrow) by positioning initially to stop blood flow proximally then advancing until flow is restored. Deployment distance = puncture depth + 2 cm. B, after TAVR, remove the prosthesis delivery system/sheath and exchange for the MANTATM sheath (which also has externally marked cm graduations) and dilator assembly (in blue). C, withdraw the dilator and introduce the MANTATM delivery system (in white) within the sheath to snap together (arrows). D, withdraw the MANTATM delivery system and sheath assembly to the calculated deployment distance and rotate lever (azure blue) in the proximal hub to release the toggle/plug distally. E, withdraw the MANTATM further and push on the collagen (in white) and radio-opaque lock (in yellow) with the tamper tube (in green) until a green indicator appears in the proximal hub (arrow) [Color figure can be viewed at wileyonlinelibrary.com]"
                }
            ]
        },
