                    caption: "Entrapped valvuloplasty balloon in the aortic valve stent frame after iatrogenic inadvertent wire passage through the outflow struts of a CoreValve Evolut PRO 26 mm (Medtroic) prosthesis (A) and an unsuccessful attempt to retrieve the entrapped NuCLEUS (B.Braun) balloon (/*) by inflation and deflation (B)"
