                    caption: "Baseline transthoracic echocardiogram. (a) Parasternal long axis view showing severe calcification and restriction of the aortice valve. (b) Parasternal long axis view showing mild to moderate aortic regurgitation with the color jet filling a portion of the left ventricular outflow tract. (c) Doppler velocity through the aortic valve with maximum aortic jet velocity 4.1 m/s, mean gradient 40 mmHg and maximum gradient. 67 mmHg [Color figure can be viewed at wileyonlinelibrary.com]."
