                    caption: "U RE 2 (a) Fluoroscopic image and (b) transesophageal echocardiography before prothesis valve implantation demonstrate the guidewire (white arrows) extending toward the anterolateral papillary muscle. LVOT, left ventricle outflow tract [Color figure can be viewed at wileyonlinelibrary.com]"
