                    caption: "Transesophageal echocardiogram images show regurgitant jet of severe aortic insufficiency in mid esophageal longaxis (panel a) and short-axis (panel b) views. Panel c shows long axis view of well seated valve-in-valve TAVR with trivial paravalvular regurgitation with corresponding short-axis image (panel d) [Color figure can be viewed at wileyonlinelibrary.com].  FIGURE 2Pre-ViV TAVR coronary angiography image show moderate left main stenosis (panel a). Coronary access was confirmed using a 5 Fr JL 3.5 after positioning of Sapien 3 valve inside Corevalve prosthesis (panel b)"
