                    caption: "Computed tomography angiography of the ascending and descending aorta on a 256-slice scanner (Brilliance iCT, Philips Medical Systems, Cleveland OH, USA) after injection of 70 cc intravenous iohexol at 5 cc/s (Omnipaque, GE Healthcare, Oslo, Norway). Image reconstruction was performed using a slice thickness of 0.67 mm with. overlap (resulting in a slice increment of 0.34 mm). Extensive calcification is present (porcelain aorta). (A) Longitudinal image of ascending and descending aorta showing diffuse calcification. (B) Short axis image of the ascending aorta showing circumfer-. ential aortic calcification (arrow)."
