                    caption: "Multidetector CT Evaluation Pre-TAVI. Computed tomography angiographic (CTA) measurements. While maintaining the orientation, the images are scrolled up to allow for short-axis measurement of the sinus of Valsalva (Panel A) and then down to provide measures of the annulus/basal ring (Panel B). In the long-axis view for the left (Panel C) and right (Panel D) coronary artery height. The coronary height was measured from the aortic annulus plane to the lower level margin of the left (Panel C) and right (Panel D) coronary ostium. TAVR = transcatheter aortic valve replacement."
