                    caption: "Valve-in-valve TAVR procedure. Deployment of the 26 mm CoreValve Evolute Pro, with proper positioning into the aortic annulus (Panel A) and evidence of bailout undeployed stent into left anterior descendente coronary (white arrow). Aortography demonstrating subtotal occlusion of the left main coronary artery (Panel B). Emergent deployment of a drugeluting stent in the left main coronary artery (Panel C - white arrow), followed by insertion of the Impella CP left ventricular assist device through the newly implanted VIV-TAVR (Panel C - red arrow) with final TimI 3 flow (Panel D - white arrow). (For interpretation of the references to color in this figure legend, the reader is referred to the web version of this artide.)"
