        pmid: "30062248",
        title: "Aorto-Right Ventricular Fistula Post-Transcatheter Aortic Valve Replacement: Multimodality Imaging of Successful Percutaneous Closure.",
        source: "CASE (Phila)",
        author: "Alan F Vainrib, Homam Ibrahim, Kazuhiro Hisamoto, Cezar S Staniloae, Hasan Jilaihawi, Ricardo J Benenstein, Larry Latson, Mathew R Williams, Muhamed Saric",
