        title: "\"Menage a Trois\": Use of 2 Supplemental Buddy Wires DuringTAVI.",
        source: "CJC Open",
        author: "Vassili Panagides, Siamak Mohammadi, Josep Rodés-Cabau, Jean-Michel Paradis",
