        author: "George Latsios, Kostas Toutouzas, Antonis Karanasos, Andreas Synetos, Maria Drakopoulou, Constantina Aggeli, Dimitris Tousoulis",
        abstract: "We describe a case of trans-femoral trans-catheter aortic valve implantation (TF-TAVI) wherein the use of a novel collagen plug-based device (i.e. Manta© device) was very successful in arterial 16 French sheath hemostasis despite an extremely hostile peripheral vessel anatomy due to calcification.",
