        author: "George Latsios, Konstantinos Toutouzas, Andreas Synetos, Antonios Mastrokostopoulos, Konstantinos Stathogiannis, Constantina Aggeli, Spyridon Papaioannou, Aggelos Papanikolaou, Eleftherios Tsiamis, Dimitris Tousoulis",
