                    caption: "Device evaluation demonstrated numerous high-power alarms (examples indicated by blue arrows).  FIGuRE 2 JenaValve Trilogy Transcatheter Heart Valve System  The valve consists of a nitinol frame with porcine pericardial leaflets. The delivery system has a deflector that allows for coaxial alignment and a controller knob that facilitates axial rotation of the valve to align the radiopaque locators in the middle of each coronary cusp."
