                    caption: "Multidetector computed tomography (MDcT) showing high takeoff of left main coronary without calcification (white arrow) (A) and the right coronary arteries Fig. 1. (B) of 1.5 and 1.2 cm, respectively. (C) Sinus of Valsalva diameters with bulky leaflet tip calcification in the left sinus (white arrow). (D) Aortic annulus area of 4.72 cm2."
