                    caption: "Multiplanar reformatted oblique views of cardiac CT angiography demonstrating (A) vegetation on the prosthetic transcatheter aortic valve replacement (TAVR; arrow), (B) thickening of all 3 TAVR leaflets demonstrating infectious involvement of the entire prosthetic valve leaflets, and (C) large vegetation on the anterior leaflet base of native mitral valve (arrow) with adjacent thickening of the mitral-aortic intervalvular fibrosa (arrowhead ), concerning for perivalvular extension of infection. (D) Involvement of both valves. Bilateral pleural effusions (/*) are also visible. Ao, aorta; LA, left atrium; LV, left ventricle; RA, right atrium."
