            Gender: "Male",
            Case: "Quadricuspid aortic valve with severe aortic regurgitation and moderate aortic stenosis.",
            Previous_History: "Congenital heart disease including a complete atrioventricular septal defect repaired in childhood, residual cleft mitral valve with severe mitral regurgitation, diabetes mellitus, morbid obesity, nonischemic cardiomyopathy with left ventricular ejection fraction of 45%, and chronic respiratory failure on home oxygen."
