                    caption: "The last transthoracic echocardiography (at one-. year follow-up) revealing (A and B) partial overlapping of the. two bioprostheses (blue asterisk) (two- and three-dimensional respectively); (C) mild to moderate associated periprosthetic leak; (D) appropriate transprosthetic gradients (maximum and. mean of 20 mmHg and 10 mmHg, respectively)."
