                    path: "D:/Romy/SAIRI/TAVI/Code/extract_downloads/10.1080_08998280.2022.2158770/images/50fefcd02d9b3b1a98046334e6ede898916740747bdaef58c4349e42c13b69bb.jpg",
                    caption: "(a) Transthoracic echocardiography noted severe aortic stenosis and elevated aortic valve peak velocity. (b) A Synergy stent was deployed in the left circumflex coronary artery (LCX) after angiography noted LCX occlusion. (c) Subsequent angiography revealed partial compromise of the LCX distal to the stented area, so another stent was deployed. (d) At 20 months post-TAVR, during catheterization for unstable angina, the LCX showed no significant in-stent restenosis. (e) At 4 years post-TAVR, during stenting of the left anterior descending coronary artery, the LCX showed no significant in-stent restenosis."
