                    caption: "(A) Cardiac computed tomography (transverse) through the aorta showing leaflet calcification in the Acurate Neo. Valve-to-aorta above the right coronary artery and left main stem, indicated feasibility of future coronary access and a low risk of sinus sequestration. (B) Cardiac computed tomography (long axis.) White arrow shows the stent in the LMCA ostium. (C) Alignment of S3 transcatheter heart valve in relation to Acurate Neo transcatheter heart valve to ensure complete leaflet coverage."
