                    caption: "(A) Pigtail placement in the right coronary sinus, centralization of the same sinus was performed, with the purpose of locating the noncoronary sinus on the left of the image and the left coronary sinus on the right side during the injection of the contrast medium. (B) Pre-dilatation with #18 balloon. (C) Position of the valve at the depth level of the right coronary sinus. (D) Valve deployment without complications."
