                    caption: "Transthoracic echocardiogram with colour flow Doppler evidencing an aortic-to-right ventricular fistula (arrowhead) status post-TAVR. Ao, aortic root; LA, left atrium; LV, left ventricle; PLAX, parasternal long axis; PSAX, parasternal short axis; RV, right ventricle."
