                    caption: "Contrast computed tomography revealed calcified transcatheter heart valve leaflets and commissures (A-C). The transcatheter heart valve area at inflow was 387 mm? (D). The transcatheter heart valve area at mid-portion was 339 mm? (E). The transcatheter heart valve area at outflow was 361 mm? (F). The minimum and maximum sino-tubular junction diameters were 24.7 and 25.6 mm (G), respectively. Distances to the left and right coronary arteries were 3.9 and 4.6 mm, respectively (H and l). The distance of the lowest ostium of the left and right coronary arteries and the bottom of transcatheter heart valve were 14.5 and 15.0 mm, respectively (I and K). The height of transcatheter heart valve was 20.5 mm (L)."
