                    caption: "(A-B) Before TAVR, transthoracic echocardiogram was performed, demonstrating a peak velocity was 4.36m/s, and a mean pressure was 44.8 mmH? in AoV, suggestive of severe AS. (C-D) After successful transsubclavian TAVR, a peak velocity was dropped to 2.06-2.14 m/s, with a reduction of mean pressure tc 7.42-7.95 mm Hg. AoV = aortic valve; AS = aortic stenosis; TAVR = transcatheter aortic valve replacement."
