                    caption: "Intraoperative angiography images are shown. (A) Aortic root angiogram just before release of the 29-mm Evolut-R prosthesis. showed a well-seated valve with flow into the LCA and RCA. (B) Post-deployment angiography showed filling of RCA, with complete obstruction of LCA. (C) Snared 29-mm Evolut-R was retracted from the aortic annulus and repositioned into the ascending aorta. (D) Post-. deployment angiography of 26-mm Evolut-R second valve placed in a more ventricular location relative to the aortic annulus showed patency. of both coronary arteries. LCA, left coronary artery; RCA, right coronary artery."
