                    caption: "TEE shows the anechoic cavity in mitro-aortic junction (A, white arrow) and color Doppler reveals a diastolic flow from P-MAIVF to LVOT (B, white arrow). Preprocedural CT scan confirms the P-MAIVF (white arrow) located between noncoronary sinus and left atrium. illustrated by longitudinal (C) and transversal (D) view of aortic root. CT 3-D reconstruction of P-MAIVF (E, white arrow). P-MAIVF visualization by fluoroscopy (F, white arrow). CT, computed tomography; LVOT, left ventricular outflow tract; P-MAlVF, pseudoaneurysm of mitral-aortic intervalvular fibrosa; TEE, transesophageal echocardiogram"
