                    caption: "Preoperative images of the gastric bleeding at the less curvature of the lower body and the result of VWF multimer analysis. a Image close to the bleeding point of the less curvature of the lower body. b Image. close to the bleeding point on the less curvature of the lower body and irrigation of the blood: no dilated blood vessels were found. c Six seconds after irrigation of the bleeding point: oozing from the mucosal surface is observed, and vascular rupture which cannot be identified by endoscopy is suspected. d The test yielded a normal result; the plasma of the patient did not lack the HMW multimers of VwF."
