                    caption: "I. (A) Fluoroscopy showing the embolized valve in the. ascending aorta (arrow). (B) Angioplasty with a Palmaz stent was initially used to stabilize the embolized valve before a second valve could be introduced. (C) A second valve was successfully implanted on the aortic root (/*). (D) A 3680-mm ZDES catheter (between arrowheads) was successfully deployed within the embolized valve, with the prosthesis positioned between the. bypass graft and innominate artery. Aortography revealed stable. valve positioning without extravasation, dissection, or aortic regurgitation."
