            Gender: "Female",
            Case: "Transcatheter aortic valve replacement (TAVR) via an antegrade transapical access (TA-TAVR) in a patient with extensive thoracic surgery history.",
            Previous_History: "Right upper and middle lobectomy for bronchial carcinoma 8 years ago, long-standing GOLD IV COPD, coronary three vessel disease, diabetes mellitus, carotid artery disease, peripheral artery disease."
