                    caption: "Video 1 In Case 1, pre-BAV was performed with a 20-mm. Z-Med-II balloon to facilitate delivery of the transcatheter valve system followed by successful transfemoral transcatheter. aortic valve replacement with 26-mm Edwards SAPIEN-3 Ultra valve; see also at https://youtu.be/tQL--I3zPY8. pre-BAV: preimplantation balloon-aortic valvuloplasty"
