                    caption: "Pre-Procedural multislice computed tomographic evaluation. Pre-operative thoraco-abdominal computed tomography angiography showed (A) an aortic annulus perimeter of 72.7 mm (area of 410,6 mm?), (B-D,E) an aortic valve severely calcified, and (C) a left ventricular outflow tract (LVOT) perimeter of 75.6 mm with elliptical shape (area of 422,6 mm?), (F) \"gothic\" and calcific aortic arch and (G) multiple calcific stenosis of both iliac-femoral vessels, severely tortuous."
