                    caption: "(A) Half-translucent ascending aorta without contrast media. (B) Atherosclerotic calcification sequence from the ascending aorta to the aortic arch. (C) Cross Fig. 1. sectional area of the annulus (419 mm?). (D) A bulky calcified lump around the sinotubular junction (white arrow head)."
